    `torch.flipud` is expected to be slower than `np.flipud`.

Args:
    input (Tensor): Must be at least 1-dimensional.

Example::

    >>> x = torch.arange(4).view(2, 2)
    >>> x
    tensor([[0, 1],
            [2, 3]])
    >>> torch.flipud(x)
    tensor([[2, 3],
            [0, 1]])

